meta {
  name: 16 - AWS Dev Tooling
  seq: 17
}

docs {
  AWS dev manual tooling for /api/local-dev/** endpoints.

  Hosted dev requires Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_admin_id_token}} from an active Firebase-backed backend user whose verified Firebase email is allowlisted in BACKOFFICE_ADMIN_EMAILS.

  Copy bruno/environments/dev.template.bru to an ignored env such as bruno/environments/dev.local.bru, fill firebase_api_key and firebase_admin_password, select it in Bruno, then run 00 through 02 before triggering jobs or timeouts.
}
